{"seq":3,"slug":"procedural-audio-spectrum","title":"程序化音频光谱","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-procedural-audio/foundations/procedural-audio-spectrum","wordCount":1528,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"程序化音频光谱\">程序化音频光谱</h1><p>&quot;程序化&quot;和&quot;采样&quot;之间不是一道墙，而是一条连续的滑轨。把任何一个游戏声音放上这条轨道，从最左端的&quot;原封不动回放一条 wav&quot;到最右端的&quot;从物理方程实时求解整段波形&quot;，中间分布着五个可辨认的档位。这一篇给出本 hub 最重要的思维工具——这条光谱——并教你如何为每个声音定位它在谱上的坐标。前两篇分别讲了动机（<a href=\"why-procedural-audio\">为何程序化音频</a>）与取舍（<a href=\"synthesis-vs-samples\">合成与采样</a>），这一篇把它们收拢成一个可操作的坐标系。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>程序化音频光谱</strong>是本 hub 最重要的思维工具：它把&quot;程序化&quot;与&quot;采样&quot;之间那道看似二元的墙，还原成一条按运行时计算量递增的连续轨道。围绕它有几个关键概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>五个档位</strong>：纯采样 → 采样+微扰 → 参数化采样 → 颗粒/拼接合成 → 纯合成，绝大多数真实声音落在中间三档。</li>\n<li><strong>分部定位</strong>：同一个声音对象可横跨多档——核心质感用采样、长尾变化用合成。</li>\n<li><strong>三问定档</strong>：招牌度、变化连续度、CPU 预算，三问把任意声音收敛到谱上坐标。</li>\n<li><strong>重心平移</strong>：整条光谱的重心随游戏品类移动，程序化生成游戏必须让声音与内容同步无限。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"五个档位-从纯回放到纯合成\">五个档位：从纯回放到纯合成</h2><p>光谱不是二元的，而是按&quot;运行时计算量&quot;递增排成的连续档。下表给出五个典型档位、各自的技术手段与代表声音：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>档位</th>\n<th>技术手段</th>\n<th>运行时计算</th>\n<th>代表声音</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>① 纯采样</td>\n<td>单条 wav 直接回放</td>\n<td>几乎为零</td>\n<td>标志性过场、片头音</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>② 采样+微扰</td>\n<td>轮播 + 随机音高/音量</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>普通枪响、撞击</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>③ 参数化采样</td>\n<td>多层素材按参数交叉淡化</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>引擎转速、风强</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>④ 颗粒/拼接合成</td>\n<td>切碎素材再重组</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>雨、人群、纹理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>⑤ 纯合成</td>\n<td>物理/信号模型实时求解</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>程序化引擎、激光、UI</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键洞察：绝大多数真实声音落在 ②③④，而非两端。纯采样浪费了变化度，纯合成牺牲了可控性与 CPU。一个成熟项目的音频表，看起来就是这五档的一张分布图——招牌声压在左侧，长尾变化声推向右侧。这条&quot;大多数东西落在中间&quot;的规律，正是<a href=\"../practice/hybrid-audio-practice\">混合落地</a>整篇要兑现的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"同一个声音可以横跨多档\">同一个声音可以横跨多档</h2><p>光谱的精妙在于：一个声音对象的不同部分可以落在不同档位。以一辆车的引擎为例——基频的轰鸣用③参数化采样（多层转速素材交叉淡化）保证招牌质感，而排气的爆裂、轮胎的摩擦、远处的多普勒尾音则用④或⑤的合成填补无限变化。下面的图展示一个引擎声如何被拆解到光谱的多个档位：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  ENGINE[引擎声需求] --&gt; CORE[核心轰鸣&lt;br/&gt;招牌质感优先]&#10;  ENGINE --&gt; TEX[排气爆裂&lt;br/&gt;需高变化]&#10;  ENGINE --&gt; ENV[环境交互&lt;br/&gt;距离/遮挡连续]&#10;  CORE --&gt; S3[档③ 参数化采样&lt;br/&gt;转速层交叉淡化]&#10;  TEX --&gt; S5[档⑤ 纯合成&lt;br/&gt;脉冲序列模型]&#10;  ENV --&gt; S4[档④ 颗粒合成&lt;br/&gt;连续纹理]&#10;  S3 --&gt; MIX[中间件统一混音]&#10;  S5 --&gt; MIX&#10;  S4 --&gt; MIX\">flowchart TD\n  ENGINE[引擎声需求] --&gt; CORE[核心轰鸣&lt;br/&gt;招牌质感优先]\n  ENGINE --&gt; TEX[排气爆裂&lt;br/&gt;需高变化]\n  ENGINE --&gt; ENV[环境交互&lt;br/&gt;距离/遮挡连续]\n  CORE --&gt; S3[档③ 参数化采样&lt;br/&gt;转速层交叉淡化]\n  TEX --&gt; S5[档⑤ 纯合成&lt;br/&gt;脉冲序列模型]\n  ENV --&gt; S4[档④ 颗粒合成&lt;br/&gt;连续纹理]\n  S3 --&gt; MIX[中间件统一混音]\n  S5 --&gt; MIX\n  S4 --&gt; MIX</pre><p>这种&quot;分部定位&quot;是高级技巧，它让你既保住招牌音色的导演控制权，又用合成吃下长尾的变化需求。怎么在中间件里把这些档位拼到一起，是系统章<a href=\"../systems/audio-middleware\">音频中间件</a>的工程内容。</p>\n<h2 id=\"定位一个声音-三问决策\">定位一个声音：三问决策</h2><p>给任意声音定档，问三个问题即可收敛。第一问：它是招牌音吗（承载品牌识别、需导演精修）？是则压向①②。第二问：它的变化需求是离散还是连续？连续（随距离/速度/力度平滑变化）则推向③④⑤。第三问：CPU 预算允许实时合成吗？不允许则向左退档。把这三问写成一个判断式，定位坐标 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>（越大越偏合成）可粗略表达为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>变化连续度</mtext><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>内存压力</mtext><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>招牌度</mtext><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>CPU紧张度</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L = w_1 \\cdot \\text{变化连续度} + w_2 \\cdot \\text{内存压力} - w_3 \\cdot \\text{招牌度} - w_4 \\cdot \\text{CPU紧张度}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">变化连续度</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">内存压力</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">招牌度</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CPU</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">紧张度</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>权重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 因项目而异——移动端 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（内存压力）权重高，竞技端则因可预测性需求抬高 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。这不是要你真去算这个式子，而是提醒：定档是多因素权衡，不是凭&quot;程序化更酷&quot;的直觉。</p>\n<h2 id=\"光谱随项目类型整体平移\">光谱随项目类型整体平移</h2><p>不同品类的游戏，整条光谱的&quot;重心&quot;位置不同。下面这张对照帮助你建立直觉：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>游戏类型</th>\n<th>光谱重心</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>线性叙事大作</td>\n<td>偏左（采样为主）</td>\n<td>招牌音多、导演控制强、可堆素材</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>开放世界</td>\n<td>居中偏右</td>\n<td>长尾变化海量、内存吃紧</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>程序化生成游戏</td>\n<td>偏右（合成为主）</td>\n<td>内容本身无限，声音须同步无限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>竞技 PvP</td>\n<td>偏左（可预测优先）</td>\n<td>声音公平性要求一致可复现</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>移动/VR</td>\n<td>偏右（内存逼迫）</td>\n<td>音频内存极紧，合成省驻留</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>注意&quot;程序化生成游戏&quot;这一行——当关卡、地形由 <code>11_procedural-content-generation</code> 的算法无限生成时，声音也必须能无限生成与之匹配，否则会出现&quot;无限世界配有限音库&quot;的违和。这是程序化音频与程序化内容生成在工程上必须协同的明确接口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>程序化与采样之间是一条<strong>连续光谱</strong>，按运行时计算量分五档：纯采样→采样+微扰→参数化采样→颗粒/拼接→纯合成。</li>\n<li>绝大多数真实声音落在中间三档；招牌音压左，长尾变化推右。</li>\n<li>同一个声音对象可<strong>横跨多档</strong>——核心质感用采样、长尾变化用合成，分部定位是高级技巧。</li>\n<li>定档靠三问：招牌度、变化连续度、CPU 预算；多因素权衡而非直觉。</li>\n<li>整条光谱的重心随游戏品类平移；程序化生成游戏必须让声音与内容同步无限。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>兑现光谱的工程：<a href=\"../practice/hybrid-audio-practice\">混合落地</a></li>\n<li>把多档拼到一起的工具：<a href=\"../systems/audio-middleware\">音频中间件</a></li>\n<li>量化背后的五维取舍：<a href=\"synthesis-vs-samples\">合成与采样</a></li>\n<li>必须协同的邻居：<code>11_procedural-content-generation</code> 的<a href=\"../../procedural-content-generation/foundations/controllability-evaluation\">可控性与评估</a></li>\n<li>完全平行的&quot;程序化光谱&quot;框架：<code>50_game-procedural-animation</code> 的<a href=\"../../game-procedural-animation/foundations/procedural-spectrum\">程序化光谱</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"程序化音频光谱","id":"程序化音频光谱"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"五个档位：从纯回放到纯合成","id":"五个档位-从纯回放到纯合成"},{"level":2,"text":"同一个声音可以横跨多档","id":"同一个声音可以横跨多档"},{"level":2,"text":"定位一个声音：三问决策","id":"定位一个声音-三问决策"},{"level":2,"text":"光谱随项目类型整体平移","id":"光谱随项目类型整体平移"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"合成与采样","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-procedural-audio/foundations/synthesis-vs-samples"},"next":{"title":"物理建模合成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-procedural-audio/synthesis/physical-modeling"}}